# Top-level .htaccess.
# Public profile (formerly /u/<username>) was removed. The app is now
# private: only authenticated users can reach any profile data, and
# there is no anonymous route for it.
#
# NOT READ: the base image sets AllowOverride None, so Apache ignores
# .htaccess files. The rules that apply are in docker/apache/app.conf.
#
# Disable directory listing for safety.
Options -Indexes
